<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Upcoming and recent events</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><div class="mb-4"><img src="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/6vXSc1CsXchvYWOHYt1nYz/en-US/im2016060710co-300dpi-1-640x426.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=1280&amp;h=720&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60" alt="im2016060710co-300dpi-1-640x426" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9" loading="lazy"/></div><h2>Siemens in the third quarter 2026</h2><p>Munich, August 6, 2026</p><p>On August 6, 2026, Siemens released its third quarter results for 2026.</p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://edge.media-server.com/mmc/p/em5zfokt">Webcast</a> (recording)<br/><a href="https://assets.new.siemens.com/siemens/assets/api/uuid:a659b574-caac-4ea1-a94f-a9d624fe0b7f/2026-q3-earnings-release-en.pdf">Q3 FY26 Earnings Release and Financial Results</a> <br/><a href="https://assets.new.siemens.com/siemens/assets/api/uuid:ce5914eb-3d82-4bf0-ba74-13f36d14689b/2026-q3-Financial-Results-Excel.xlsx">Financial Results in Excel</a><br/><a href="https://assets.new.siemens.com/siemens/assets/api/uuid:86d29dce-05bf-4417-bb0f-314b666bcd8b/2026-q3-press-release-en.pdf">Press Release “Record third quarter – Outlook raised”</a><br/><a href="https://assets.new.siemens.com/siemens/assets/api/uuid:d4a50737-d5e4-4447-b81d-56f7f974db90/2026-q3-presentation-en.pdf">Presentation “Record third quarter – Outlook raised”</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div>


